{"a":[44,45],"h":"<p>44.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"165\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 164.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 30.0 38.3 45.0 45.0 51.8 67.6 74.3 74.3 82.6 98.3 98.3 107.3 107.3 115.6 115.6 122.3 122.3 129.0 129.0 141.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 38.3 51.8 67.6 82.6 122.3 141.8 148.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ona kavuşacakları gün - öldükleri yâhud kabirden çıktıkları, yâhud Cennete girdikleri gün tahiyleri<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"63\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 62.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.1 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"28.6 35.3 35.3 46.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> selâm - her türlü mahzur ve afattan selâmet haberidir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"116\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 116.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 32.3 39.0 39.0 46.6 66.7 73.6 73.6 81.0 81.0 93.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"46.6 93.0 99.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ecri kerîm - Cennet 45.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"75\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 75.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 32.2 32.2 41.2 48.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"48.0 59.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Bir şâhid olmak üzere - Allahın birliğine şâhid, Allaha nasıl kulluk edileceğine istişhad edilecek örnek, ümmetin tasdikı tekzibi, icâbeti, ademi icâbeti gibi ahvaline, âmaline yarın Âhırette huzurı ilâhîde şehadet edecek şâhid 46. </p>"}